The files in data/ (codes.json, codes.csv and year-letters.json) are adapted from
these Wikipedia articles, written by Wikipedia contributors. The files in source/
are unchanged extracts of the same articles.

  "Vehicle registration plates of the United Kingdom", revision 1383646012
  https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Vehicle_registration_plates_of_the_United_Kingdom&oldid=1383646012

  "Vehicle registration plates of Northern Ireland", revision 1383671713
  https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Vehicle_registration_plates_of_Northern_Ireland&oldid=1383671713

Changes: the code tables and year-letter tables were converted to JSON and CSV;
footnotes and links were removed; each authority's years and notes were split into
separate fields; earlier holders that the source gives only in a note were made into
their own dated entries.

